    "target": "Tresor-era Berlin flyer: distorted or stretched display type, a dense information block, one saturated colour on black",
    "method": "type is stretched by extrusion, not by scaling -- a repeat wrapping a single text op steps it one pixel at a time to smear the word vertically and horizontally, because group scale is uniform only and there is no non-uniform transform. The information block is one wrapped text op; the colour budget is a single acid green.",
    "notDone": "no condensed or bold face exists, so the display type is PT Sans Regular smeared; no true horizontal compression, no skew, no outline-only display type, and no photographic ground"
  },
